  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till Amhara kvinnliga f&#xF6;retagarf&#xF6;rening (AWEA). Projektet syftar till att st&#xE4;rka kapaciteten hos AWEA s&#xE5; att AWEA blir en stark medlems organisation och ger service till sina medlemmar p&#xE5; ett effektivt s&#xE4;tt. F&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntade resultat: f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad kapacitet hos f&#xF6;reningen, f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra medlemsservice och inkomstgenererade aktiviteter</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Amhara Women&apos;s Entrepreneurs Association (AWEA). Project purpose to further strengthen the capacity of AWEA to become a sustainable and effcient business member organisation providing services to its members. Expected results: Increaased operational efficiency 2) member services (provision of land, network service, BDS), c) income generating activities for AWEA</narrative>
  </description>
